    "The number is average forecast deviation from measured temperature, not an integration fault. Ratings are practical guidance. Color requires at least 20 comparisons. Green also requires beating the no-change benchmark.": "Talan er meðalfrávik, ekki kerfisvilla. Leiðbeinandi; litur þarf 20 samanburði, grænt einnig betra en óbreytt viðmið.",
